{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42148","headline":"欧阳太监雨中视决堤因堕水明日见於省中因戏之 · 徐铉","name":"欧阳太监雨中视决堤因堕水明日见於省中因戏之","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"闻道张晨盖，徘徊石首东。\n濬川非伯禹，落水异三公。\n衣湿仍愁雨，冠欹更怯风。\n今朝复相见，疑是葛仙翁。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"徐铉","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_42148.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42148","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}